    "num": "dbsjeyarajcom-74412d31",
    "date_str": "2025-01-01",
    "description": "No Govt can cut direct taxes, maintain high military expenditure, keep white elephants like Sri Lankan going, manage the debt burden, and keep the economy afloat, without imposing huge burdens on ordinary masses.",
    "url_metadata": "https://dbsjeyaraj.com/dbsj/?p=85292",
