    "description": "New year, new political culture: President Dissanayake outlines vision for Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/104638/new-year-new-political-culture-president-dissanayake-outlines-vision-for-sri-lanka",
    "lang": "en",
