    "chunk_text": "The President also called attention to the new political culture ushered in with the New Year. \u201cThe entire political establishment is ready to fulfill the challenge of rebuilding the country. This year has begun with a new political culture, and we are committed to sustaining it,\u201d he stated.\n\nLooking ahead, President Dissanayake revealed the government\u2019s three primary objectives as part of its comprehensive development plan.\n\n\u201cThe Clean Sri Lanka program, in particular, aims to rebuild our dilapidated motherland by ensuring accountability and transparency in every sector\u201d , he signed off."
