    "description": "US imposes sanctions on Russian and Iranian groups over disinformation targeting American voters",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/104639/us-imposes-sanctions-on-russian-and-iranian-groups-over-disinformation-targeting-american-voters",
    "lang": "en",
