    "description": "Govt. says funding needy school children  to purchase stationery ensures education for all",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Govt-says-funding-needy-school-children-to-purchase-stationery-ensures-education-for-all/56-771289",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
