    "description": "SAGT surpasses two million TEU milestone again in 2024",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/SAGT-surpasses-two-million-TEU-milestone-again-in-2024/56-771302",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
