    "description": "Health sector to get highest-ever fund allocation through 2025 Budget \u2013 Minister",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/104675/health-sector-to-get-highest-ever-fund-allocation-through-2025-budget-minister-",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
