    "description": "India funds rehabilitation of Sri Lanka\u2019s Karainagar Boatyard",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/104680/india-funds-rehabilitation-of-sri-lankas-karainagar-boatyard",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
