    "date_str": "2025-01-03",
    "description": "Psychological toll of online child sexual abuse: Call for rights-based approaches",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Psychological-toll-of-online-child-sexual-abuse-Call-for-rights-based-approaches/4-771331",
