    "description": "Sri Lanka among 25 nations with high religious restrictions, India tops list: Data",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/104686/sri-lanka-among-25-nations-with-high-religious-restrictions-india-tops-list-data",
    "lang": "en",
