    "description": "South Korean presidential guards prevent arrest of impeached Yoon after tense stand-off",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/104704/south-korean-presidential-guards-prevent-arrest-of-impeached-yoon-after-tense-stand-off",
    "lang": "en",
