    "description": "Sri Lanka holds trade, investment and tourism promotion forum at Eastern Province of Saudi Arabia",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Sri-Lanka-holds-trade-investment-and-tourism-promotion-forum-at-Eastern-Province-of-Saudi-Arabia/34-771383",
