    "description": "Govt. denies claims of suppressing street hawkers under Clean Sri Lanka program",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Govt-denies-claims-of-suppressing-street-hawkers-under-Clean-Sri-Lanka-program/56-771387",
    "lang": "en",
