    "description": "Trump must be sentenced in hush money case, judge signals no jail",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/104709/trump-must-be-sentenced-in-hush-money-case-judge-signals-no-jail",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
