    "chunk_text": "\u201cWhere there were less officers in some District Secretary areas in the East we have sent more officers and we are doing the checks.\u201d\n\nSri Lanka\u2019s rice stocks go down ahead of the main Maha rice harvest and rice imports are allowed in January.\n\nThe price controls led to the disappearance of some kinds of rice shop shelves, particularly red raw.\n\nRaw rice vanish from Sri Lanka shop shelves after CAA price controls\n\nThe CAA has previously created shortages of dhall, sugar, tinned fish with its price controls, leading to public displeasure and loss of confidence in the economic policies of successive governments.\n\nThe CAA also decimated the layer chicken farms, during an economic crisis with its price controls on eggs.\n\nSri Lanka Minister apologizes for creating shortages, gives up on price controls\n\nThe agency also created shortages for a people battered with the economic crisis as the central bank printed money to cut rates. The then Trade Minister then lifted price controls, allowed food to come ot the shelves, and apologized to the people for the hardships created though price controls."
