    "description": "Sri Lanka to review Adani\u2019s energy projects tomorrow",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/104725/sri-lanka-to-review-adanis-energy-projects-tomorrow",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
