    "description": "Ogilvy\u2019s Geometry Global becomes only SL agency to win at global Epica Awards 2024",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/ogilvys-geometry-global-becomes-only-sl-agency-to-win-at-global-epica-awards-2024/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
