    "description": "AKD and Clean Sri Lanka project: Good start but much more needed to done at ground level",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/AKD-and-Clean-Sri-Lanka-project-Good-start-but-much-more-needed-to-done-at-ground-level/4-771408",
    "lang": "en",
