    "description": "FUTA demands Govt. investigation into banning of anti-IMF seminar at UoP",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/FUTA-demands-Govt-investigation-into-banning-of-anti-IMF-seminar-at-UoP/56-771455",
    "lang": "en",
