    "description": "No direct talks with foreign missions: New circular tightens Sri Lanka\u2019s diplomatic protocols",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/104752/no-direct-talks-with-foreign-missions-new-circular-tightens-sri-lankas-diplomatic-protocols-",
    "lang": "en",
