    "description": "HMPV cases surge in Malaysia, India and Hong Kong: Is it a new disease?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/104770/hmpv-cases-surge-in-malaysia-india-and-hong-kong-is-it-a-new-disease-",
