    "description": "Canada PM Trudeau is likely to announce resignation, source says",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/104772/canada-pm-trudeau-is-likely-to-announce-resignation-source-says",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
    "time_ut": 1736174940.0,
