    "description": "Graveside memorial service to mark  16th  anniversary  of Lasantha\u2019s assassination On Wednesday 8 January 9 a.m. at Borella Kanatte",
    "url_metadata": "https://dbsjeyaraj.com/dbsj/?p=85308",
    "lang": "en",
