    "description": "President Anura Kumara Dissanayake to  be in  China from January 14 to 17 2025 on second state visit abroad one month after Indian visit: will be accompanied by Minister of Foreign AffairsVijitha Herath, and Transport Minister  Bimal Rathnayake; Debt treatment and bilateral development cooperation  expected to be discussed in Beijing",
    "url_metadata": "https://dbsjeyaraj.com/dbsj/?p=85310",
