    "description": "Draft Bill to call for fresh nominations for LG polls gazetted",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/104776/draft-bill-to-call-for-fresh-nominations-for-lg-polls-gazetted",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
    "time_ut": 1736216400.0,
