    "description": "Sri Lanka can build reserves, pay debt, with vehicle imports of $1.5bn: CB Governor",
    "url_metadata": "https://economynext.com/sri-lanka-can-build-reserves-pay-debt-with-vehicle-imports-of-1-5bn-cb-governor-198351/",
    "lang": "en",
