    "description": "Eye surgery complications at N\u2019Eliya Hospital: Compensation up to Rs. 1M for patients",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/104798/eye-surgery-complications-at-neliya-hospital-compensation-up-to-rs-1m-for-patients",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
    "time_ut": 1736241060.0,
