    "description": "More details emerge about Mount Lavinia shooting that killed 2",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/104812/more-details-emerge-about-mount-lavinia-shooting-that-killed-2",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
    "time_ut": 1736265240.0,
