    "chunk_text": "He specifically criticised the Government for failing to reduce electricity bills as pledged, despite profits being made. \u201cWhy is the Government failing to provide relief to those living under the poverty line with the profits they have earned?\u201d he asked.\n\nMarikkar also voiced concerns over the plight of senior citizens, who are suffering due to the increased withholding tax on fixed deposits. He accused the current administration of continuing the same exploitative policies as its predecessor, led by former President Ranil Wickremesinghe.\n\nThe MP questioned what new revenue-generating measures the Government has introduced, while extending an offer of support from the opposition to help improve government income. However, he insisted that the Government must first admit to misleading the public with false promises during the election campaign."
