    "description": "Clean Sri Lanka and digital economy initiatives: New pragmatic face of NPP?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Clean-Sri-Lanka-and-digital-economy-initiatives-New-pragmatic-face-of-NPP/4-771539",
