    "description": "E-service for copies of birth, marriage and death certificates for overseas Sri Lankans launched",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/104817/e-service-for-copies-of-birth-marriage-and-death-certificates-for-overseas-sri-lankans-launched-",
