    "description": "Sri Lanka govt launches strategic initiative for commercialization of R&D",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/104836/sri-lanka-govt-launches-strategic-initiative-for-commercialization-of-rd",
    "lang": "en",
