    "description": "Govt. will bring killers of Lasantha Wickrematunge to book soon \u2013 Justice Minister",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Govt-will-bring-killers-of-Lasantha-Wickrematunge-to-book-soon-Justice-Minister/56-771622",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
