    "description": "One person injured in shooting at Ahungalla",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/104838/one-person-injured-in-shooting-at-ahungalla",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
    "time_ut": 1736388780.0,
    "chunk_id": "2025-01-09-adaderanalk-50b40d1f-0000",
    "chunk_index": 0,
    "language": "en",
    "md5": "782901627cc4599981eee3fe9fd29de3",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 726,
    "chunk_text": "One person injured in shooting at Ahungalla\n\nOne person has reportedly been injured in a shooting incident at Ahungalla Junction this morning (09).\n\nThe injured person has been admitted to the Balapitiya Base Hospital, police said.\n\nPolice Spokesman SSP Buddhika Manatunga said the shooting was carried out at around 6.15 a.m. today by two unidentified gunmen who had arrived on a red color scooter.\n\nThe person injured in the shooting is allegedly a relative of the underworld figure and criminal gang leader Sujeewa Ruwankumara, also known as \u201cLoku Patty\u201d.\n\nIt is reported that the shooting victim is employed as a three-wheeler driver and that he had been shot while at the three-wheeler park in the Ahungalla Junction."
  },
