    "description": "TRCSL to ban use of unregistered mobile phones?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/104842/trcsl-to-ban-use-of-unregistered-mobile-phones",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
