    "description": "Police reunite Sri Lankan mother with daughter in Pakistan and ensure custody",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/104857/police-reunite-sri-lankan-mother-with-daughter-in-pakistan-and-ensure-custody",
    "lang": "en",
