    "description": "All five living US presidents unite at funeral of Jimmy Carter",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/104858/all-five-living-us-presidents-unite-at-funeral-of-jimmy-carter",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
