    "description": "Tiger \u201cCol.\u201d Charles was mastermind behind Katunayake Airport attack",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Tiger-Col-Charles-was-mastermind-behind-Katunayake-Airport-attack/4-771663",
