    "description": "The Eminently Predictable  Public Uproar Over the Attorney-General\u2019s Personal Directive to the CID to Release Three  key Suspects Relating to the Magisterial Inquiry into the 2009 Assassination of \u201cSunday Leader\u201d Editor Lasantha Wickrematunge",
