    "num": "dbsjeyarajcom-5f64413f",
    "date_str": "2025-02-25",
    "description": "Was  Notorious Gangster Ganemulla Sanjeewa Involved  in a Plot Hatched by Diaspora Elements to    Murder Ex-MP for Jaffna,  MA  Sumanthiran?",
    "url_metadata": "https://dbsjeyaraj.com/dbsj/?p=85596",
