    "description": "What the NPP/JVP does today would decide how Sri Lanka fares in the years ahead. The potentialities are many, but ignorance, myopia, and habit can lead us astray, again.",
    "url_metadata": "https://dbsjeyaraj.com/dbsj/?p=85637",
