    "description": "The UK Sanctions Former Army Commanders Shavindra Silva and Jagath Jayasuriya  , Ex-Navy Commander Wasantha Karannagoda and  Former LTTE and TMVP Commander Vinayagamoorthy Muralitharan alias \u201cCol\u201dKaruna for serious human rights violations and abuses during the civil war in Sri Lanka.",
