    "date_str": "2025-03-24",
    "description": "The \u2018Batalanda torture camp,\u2019  atrocity has created a  diversionary red herring for the JVP led-NPP Govt. The \u201d Batalanda ghost\u2019 has conveniently lessened public heat on the Govt\u2019s failure to keep hugely important campaign promises",
    "url_metadata": "https://dbsjeyaraj.com/dbsj/?p=85718",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dbsjeyarajcom",
