    "num": "dbsjeyarajcom-3844a504",
    "date_str": "2025-04-09",
    "description": "Politicization of the Military,Rajapaksa  Family\u2019s Divisive Politics  and the  Sarath Fonseka-  Jagath Jayasuriya Feud",
    "url_metadata": "https://dbsjeyaraj.com/dbsj/?p=85768",
