    "date_str": "2025-05-20",
    "description": "Will the ineptitude of the Anura Kumara  Dissanayake administration open the door to a  Future Namal Rajapaksa presidency?",
    "url_metadata": "https://dbsjeyaraj.com/dbsj/?p=85916",
    "lang": "en",
