    "description": "Renowned Sri Lankan actress  Malini Fonseka who played the female lead in the Tamil film \u2018Pilot Premnath\u2019 starring Sivaji Ganesan  passes away in Colombo on Saturday (May 24, 2025) at the age of 78.",
    "url_metadata": "https://dbsjeyaraj.com/dbsj/?p=85924",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dbsjeyarajcom",
    "time_ut": 1748089800.0,
