    "chunk_text": "Bringing the culprits to justice, namely a former Central Province Education Department chief accountant, an education director and several businessmen, the Central Province High Court remarked very rightly that this was an unconscionable crime committed against a public officer.\n\nThis Government must be roundly informed \u2013 in common with previous Governments \u2013 that accountability is not a sword that is directed against the opposition only. Rather, the true mettle of that sword lies when it is turned inwards and is exercised against the Government itself."
