    "description": "Sri Lanka and China sign two Memorandae of Understanding to set up a working group on trade facilitation, and on industrial and supply chain cooperation, says   the Chinese Embassy in Colombo meeting was jointly chaired by China\u2019s Commerce Minister Wang Wentao and Sri Lankan Minister of Trade, Commerce, Food Security and Co-operative Development Wasantha Samarasinghe.",
