    "description": "\u201cCapt. Miller\u201d the LTTE\u2019s first Black Tiger suicide bomber: 5 July 1987 Nelliaddy attack gave birth to the Black Tigers",
    "url_metadata": "https://dbsjeyaraj.com/dbsj/?p=86100",
