    "description": "How Sri Lanka\u2019s Trump tariff compares with competitors",
    "url_metadata": "https://economynext.com/how-sri-lankas-trump-tariff-compares-with-competitors-229819/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "economynextcom",
