    "chunk_text": "The current world situation poses an existential crisis for the Planet Earth. The Israel and Palestine war has enlarged into a three nations war with Iran\u2019s entry and Air strikes on Israel and latter\u2019s counter attacks. The further escalation and enlargement of this war poses the possibility of intensifying it into a world war, with dire consequences to the destruction of the Planet Earth with the deployment of nuclear warheads. The national leaders of these countries seem to think that the Planet Earth is their national property which they can destroy, at their will and fancy, in the name of religious bigotry and absolutism and claiming monopoly of their respective Gods. They are afflicted with lunacy and fanaticism. These Egoistic leaders did not create the Planet Earth nor do they have the proprietary right to destroy it at their will and decimate humanity.\n\nIn the event of the formation of the World Parliament, the UNO has to be dissolved and superseded and replaced by the World Parliament, while its affiliated Agencies, referred above, remaining as its integral Agencies."
  },
