    "description": "\u201cJust as we breathe again\u201d: Trump\u2019s tariff blow to Sri Lanka\u2019s fragile recovery",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Just-as-we-breathe-again-Trump-s-tariff-blow-to-Sri-Lanka-s-fragile-recovery/4-778826",
