    "description": "Transparency International fumes over Govt.\u2019s inertia over RTI Chief vacancy",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Transparency-International-fumes-over-Govt-s-inertia-over-RTI-Chief-vacancy/56-778851",
    "lang": "en",
