    "num": "dailyftlk-c3c45d2e",
    "date_str": "2025-07-11",
    "description": "Funding climate resilience on the ground: How global funds can reach local actors",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Funding-climate-resilience-on-the-ground-How-global-funds-can-reach-local-actors/4-778883",
