    "description": "Dialog Enterprise deploys innovative video surveillance solution to enhance customer service at Domino\u2019s Pizza Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Dialog-Enterprise-deploys-innovative-video-surveillance-solution-to-enhance-customer-service-at-Domino-s-Pizza-Sri-Lanka/34-778891",
