    "description": "The Ilankai Thamil Arasuk Katchi(ITAK)wants President Anura Kumara Dissanayake to take urgent and decisive action regarding the exhumation of human remains at Chemmani in Jaffna.",
    "url_metadata": "https://dbsjeyaraj.com/dbsj/?p=86127",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dbsjeyarajcom",
    "time_ut": 1752323400.0,
