    "chunk_text": "Trump tariff of 30-pct for EU and Mexico, India said to expect below 20-pct\n\nECONOMYNEXT \u2013 US President Donald Trump has charged 30 percent tariffs from the European Union and Mexico, in tariff letters posted on his social media platform amid a report that India is expecting a rate below 20 percent.\n\nTrump said Mexico has not done enough to stop cartels from turning the US into a \u2018Narco Trafficking Playground.\u2019\n\n\u201cMexico has been helping me secure the border, BUT, what Mexico has done, is not enough,\u201d he said.\n\nThe EU letter contained his standard language, that there is a trade deficit, which the EU has done little to correct.\n\nThe US trade deficit is a result of foreign investments made in the country, including by EU countries like Germany.\n\nHe threatened further tariffs against the EU if it tried to retaliate. Trump had separately struck a 10 percent deal with the UK.\n\nIndia is expecting a rate below 20 percent, Bloomberg Newswires reported, citing sources familiar with the matter.\n\nSri Lanka\u2019s apparel exporters had also warned earlier that India may get a rate below its current 26 percent. (Colombo/July12/2025)"
