    "description": "Reflections on \u201cRhythm of the Guitar\u201d: Clarence as a classic \u201cstart-up\u201d",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Reflections-on-Rhythm-of-the-Guitar-Clarence-as-a-classic-start-up/4-778907",
