    "description": "US says \u2018specific steps\u2019 agreed to end Syria violence after Israeli strikes hit Damascus",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/110558/us-says-specific-steps-agreed-to-end-syria-violence-after-israeli-strikes-hit-damascus",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
