    "description": "Two arrested over abduction and murder of youth in Kahawatta remanded",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/110572/two-arrested-over-abduction-and-murder-of-youth-in-kahawatta-remanded",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
    "time_ut": 1752743460.0,
