    "description": "Donald Trump says India and US very close to finalising trade deal",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/110574/donald-trump-says-india-and-us-very-close-to-finalising-trade-deal",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
