    "description": "SC annuls injunction over compulsory retirement age of nurses",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/110579/sc-annuls-injunction-over-compulsory-retirement-age-of-nurses",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
