    "description": "UK to lower voting age to 16 in landmark electoral reform",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/110581/uk-to-lower-voting-age-to-16-in-landmark-electoral-reform",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
    "time_ut": 1752753840.0,
    "chunk_id": "2025-07-17-adaderanalk-082c4602-0000",
