    "description": "President inaugurates wax museum at historic Ehelepola Walawwa in Kandy",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/110582/president-inaugurates-wax-museum-at-historic-ehelepola-walawwa-in-kandy",
    "lang": "en",
