    "description": "Nation that lets its elephants die has lost its soul",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Nation-that-lets-its-elephants-die-has-lost-its-soul/4-779124",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
