    "md5": "03250aa09fffd334cb4b08da0ab4898d",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1973,
    "chunk_text": "Exporters invited to join Sri Lanka Brands Forum at World Expo in Osaka\n\nThe National Chamber of Exporters of Sri Lanka (NCE), in collaboration with the Embassy of Sri Lanka in Japan, has announced the \u201cSri Lankan Export Brands Forum\u201d, taking place on 25 September, at the prestigious World Expo in Osaka, Japan.\n\nThis event is part of NCE\u2019s broader effort to open new trade gateways and is a significant market access initiative aimed at helping Sri Lankan exporters enter or expand in the Japanese market \u2014 one of the most sophisticated and high-value economies in Asia.\n\nHeld under the theme \u201cSri Lankan Export Brands\u201d, the forum will include a Mini Expo and targeted B2B meetings, offering exporters a unique platform to connect directly with Japanese importers, buyers, distributors, and trade intermediaries.\n\nParticipating in this event offers Sri Lankan exporters direct access to one of Asia\u2019s most valuable and stable markets. Japan is known for its high demand for quality, ethically sourced products, and this forum provides a focused platform to showcase Sri Lankan offerings to verified Japanese importers, distributors, and trade partners. With curated B2B meetings arranged in collaboration with the Osaka Chamber of Commerce and other sectoral bodies, exporters will have the chance to form meaningful, long-term trade relationships in a business culture that values trust and consistency.\n\nBeyond trade connections, this event offers unmatched brand visibility at a global venue that attracts over 75,000 daily visitors, while also providing key market intelligence on Japanese consumer preferences, pricing models, and regulatory expectations. Participating companies will gain not only commercial leads but also enhanced credibility and positioning in the eyes of international buyers. This is a unique opportunity to elevate your brand and establish a strong foothold in the Japanese market under the prestigious NCE and Embassy platform."
  },
