    "description": "Fairly heavy rainfall above 50 mm likely in some areas",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/110589/fairly-heavy-rainfall-above-50-mm-likely-in-some-areas",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
